   "id": 519051,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Veronica and Jose are debating if they should deposit $15,000 now in an account or if they should wait 10 years and deposit $25,000. If they deposit money now, the money will grow for 35 years. If they wait 10 years, it will grow for 25 years. Their account earns 5.25% interest compounded weekly. Which plan will result in the most money, depositing $15,000 now or depositing $25,000 in 10 years?",
